# AI Vault Governance

Before planning or editing `repos/ai-vault`, read its `.rules`, `CLAUDE.md`,
and `CONTRIBUTING.md`. Add their completion obligations to the task checklist.

Git inspection is read-only. Never run `git add`, `git commit`, or `git push`
for ai-vault.

After EXECUTE changes, run `scripts/commit_handoff.py render` against ai-vault
with the semantic title and one-paragraph description. Paste its two Markdown
blocks exactly:

1. One `git add -- <changed paths>` command.
2. One `git commit` command with exactly two `-m` flags.

The second `-m` value is one paragraph wrapped at 70 characters with no blank
line. Never use a HEREDOC or additional `-m` flags.
